          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5.5 Summary"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.166,
            0.578,
            0.184
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In this chapter, you have studied the following points :"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.189,
            0.902,
            0.242
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " An "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "arithmetic progression",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (AP) is a list of numbers in which each term is obtained by adding a fixed number d to the preceding term, except the first term. The fixed number d is called the "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "common difference",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.249,
            0.65,
            0.266
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The general form of an AP is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a, \\; a+d, \\; a+2d, \\; a+3d, \\; \\ldots"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.273,
            0.898,
            0.31
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " A given list of numbers "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a_{1}, a_{2}, a_{3}, \\cdots"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is an AP, if the differences "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a_{_2} - a_{_1}, a_{_3} - a_{_2},"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a _ { 4 } - a _ { 3 } , \\ldots , \\mathrm { g i v e }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " the same value, i.e., if "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a _ { { } _ { k + 1 } } - a _ { { } _ { k } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is the same for different values of k."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.313,
            0.9,
            0.352
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " In an AP with first term a and common difference d, the nth term (or the general term) is given by "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a_{n}=a+(n-1)"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " d."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.358,
            0.585,
            0.376
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " The sum of the first n terms of an AP is given by :"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.377,
            0.393,
            0.585,
            0.426
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_23_equation_9.jpg",
          "content": "\\mathbb { S } = \\; { \\frac { n } { 2 } } { \\big [ } 2 a + ( n - 1 ) d { \\big ] }"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.434,
            0.9,
            0.471
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " If l is the last term of the finite AP, say the nth term, then the sum of all terms of the AP is given by :"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.382,
            0.486,
            0.502,
            0.519
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_23_equation_11.jpg",
          "content": "S = \\frac{n}{2}(a + l)"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.364,
            0.572,
            0.634,
            0.593
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A NOTE TO THE READER"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.139,
            0.62,
            0.855,
            0.68
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "If a, b, c are in AP, then "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\overline{b} \\geq \\frac{\\overline{a} + \\overline{c}}{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and b is called the arithmetic mean of a and c."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
